A Wardley Map positions business or technology components on a two-axis canvas: visibility (how visible to the customer, Y-axis) vs. evolution (how commoditised, X-axis). Use it for strategic technology planning, make-vs-buy decisions, and platform architecture. ''New in Mermaid 11.'' Uses `wardley-beta`.

---

!! Basic example

```
wardley-beta
    title Platform Strategy
    anchor Customer [0.9, 0.95]
    component WebApp [0.8, 0.6] (buy)
    component API [0.6, 0.5] (build)
    component Database [0.3, 0.7] (outsource)
    Customer -> WebApp
    WebApp -> API
    API -> Database
```

